How to access “nano-banana-pro”

Three simple steps:

    Go to Gemini.

    Click on “Tools” + “Create images”.

    Or simply click at the top on “Try it”.




Why is it so good?

We call it SOTA = State-of-the-art = The best at [X].

From my first vibe check, Gemini is now SOTA on:

    Making the most realistic pictures.

    Being the best for adding text to an image.

    Being the best for editing images (like Photoshop).

Here are my favorite case studies:

1 - Change your hairstyle.

Prompt: “change my hairstyle to [source]”



2 - Restore old photos.

Prompt: “restore this old photo with today's realistic colors“



3 - Create a magazine.

Prompt: “Put this whole text, verbatim, into a photo of a glossy magazine article on a desk, with photos, beautiful typography design, pull quotes and brave formatting. The text: [...the unformatted article]”.

Image


4 - Add puppies (from Anisha Jain).

Prompt: “Add 16–20 bichon frises, bright white fluffy coats, small round ears, black noses. Distribute them along the sidewalk and curb at varying depths so it looks real. A few near the sitting bench, a few crossing the curb. Keep scale toy-size. Keep subject in a white outfit with sandals and white cloth unchanged. Crisp, editorial look. Negative/avoid: no gray/muddy fur, no clipping through curbs, no dogs in the room, no occlusion of the subject’s torso or face.”

Just so you know, this case study went extremely viral.



5 - Edit this specific part.

Prompt: “change X on right/left with Y”



6 - Wikipedia article to infographic.

Prompt: “Make an infographic of this person’s life based on this article: [Wikipedia Page]”



7 - Change the color of anything.

Prompt: “Recolor this picture with [x] colors from [source].”



8 - Create an action figure of me.

Prompt: “Create an image of my own custom figurine when I was at an F1 race.”



9 - Blurred photo to ultra sharp:

Prompt: “Take the provided blurred photo and transform it into an ultra-sharp, realistic editorial shot without changing the composition or objects.”



10 - Weird mundane picture:

Prompt: “The most weird mundane photo you can imagine.”



11 - Picture hand drew on whiteboard (from X):

Prompt: “Create a photo of Vagabonds Musashi praying down on a glass whiteboard in a slightly faded green marker.”

